      "content": "thanks. i've also been seeing a lot of people online talking about how these cities are basically a way for the government to restrict where people can drive or even trap them in certain zones. some people are calling it a way to implement massive surveillance and control how we move. do you think those are just conspiracy theories or is there actually a logical basis for those concerns?",
